# Contact form delivery is handled by Web3Forms (api.web3forms.com).
# The access key is hard-coded in components/CTA.tsx because Web3Forms
# access keys are public by design (they only authorize submissions to
# the email registered on the dashboard). No environment variables are
# required for the form to work.
#
# Manage the key / change recipient / rotate at:
#   https://web3forms.com/dashboard
